Error [E0003]: A function return type uses `:`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_declaration_binding.jet:11:36
    |
 11 | def multiply(left: Int, right: Int): Int {
    |                                    ^
 Why: Jet uses `:` for parameter and field types; callable bodies use `->`
 Fix: Replace `:` with `->` before the return type
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003

